# `make stack` creates .env when it is missing, with a fresh scrypt hash of
# PHOEBE_DEV_PASSWORD (default: larkspur-demo). This file only shows the format.
# PHOEBE_PASSWORD_HASH is an scrypt hash and contains `$`. Docker Compose
# interpolates `$` in .env values, so keep the value in SINGLE quotes (literal)
# or write each `$` as `$$`. Generate one with:
#   uv run python -m phoebe.auth 'your-password'
PHOEBE_PASSWORD_HASH='scrypt$32768$8$1$<salt>$<digest>'
# Host port for the API (the container always listens on 8080).
# PHOEBE_PORT=8080
